# Mutable E/T-series work products never enter the reviewed archive directly.
**/work/
**/cache/
**/models/
**/outputs/
**/results/
**/raw/
**/predictions/
**/logs/
**/captures/
**/checkpoints/
**/exports/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/

# Model artefacts remain local even if placed elsewhere by mistake.
# Row-level tables are rejected by the archive validator rather than broad
# filename ignores, so legitimate diagnostic source files remain trackable.
**/*.pkl
**/*.pickle
**/*.joblib
**/*.npy
**/*.npz
**/*.onnx
**/*.tflite
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.h5
